{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"尼日利亚","country_iso":"NGA","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:01:01.626362","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"NGA-HB-0007","ldc":"No","location":"克罗斯河州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"尼日利亚卡拉巴尔大学柴光储总承包项目","project_name_en":"Nigeria University Diesel-PV-BESS EPC Project (Calabar)","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"东方电气集团国际合作有限公司","content":"近日，尼日利亚大学及教学医院柴光储总承包项目完成72小时试运行，获得业主监理签发的完工证书。这标志着电站正式投入运行，进入运维阶段。\n该项目位于克罗斯河州首府的卡拉巴尔大学校园内，包含新建一座柴、光、储电站和培训大楼，以及升级改造配套供配电网。该电站通过多能互补、智能化管理，实现能源的实时监测、优化调节、高效运行和智能控制，大幅提升能源利用效率。\n电站投运后，在正常气候条件下，仅使用光伏和储能系统，就可为卡拉巴尔大学及其附属医院提供优质可靠的不间断电力。在极端天气情况下，柴油机发电系统仍然能够提供稳定的电力供给。同时，可再生能源培训大楼将为大学生提供技术培训和实践机会，为尼日利亚未来新能源发展提供技术和人才支持。\n该项目施工以来，面对当地高温湿热、物资匮乏、突发疟疾等多重挑战，东方国际项目部以实际行动弘扬“东汽精神”，坚定信心、迎难而上，有效应对突发状况，以高质量的履约获得业主一致好评。\n下一步，东方国际项目部将继续践行“绿色动力 驱动未来”使命，为尼日利亚青年学子搭建学习、交流、成长的可持续发展平台，为当地社会经济发展提供新机遇、注入新动能。","content_sha256":"0fdadffe0e54c9c32414adc617452254e3bbe8b2a6eecb335f3c57aa3bb966ae","id":5179,"publish_date":"2025-01-02 22:37:02","title":"绿色动力点亮尼日利亚大学校园","title_sha256":"c7799161bb35f1e98cfd322d011d18db6e0eeacae679151c4cf06e519fde5193","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/77038.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"NGA-HB-0007","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:01:01.626733","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"NGA-HB-0007-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.nengyuanjie.net/article/64640.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"东方国际项目部","project_developer_en":"Oriental International Project Department","project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"东方国际项目部在尼日利亚承建了卡拉巴尔大学柴光储总承包项目，该项目已完成试运行并获得完工证书。项目包含柴油、光伏和储能系统，旨在为大学及其附属医院提供不间断电力，并为当地提供新能源培训。","publish_date":"2025-01-02 22:37:02","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/77038.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"NGA-HB-0007","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category","storage_text_signal"]}
